/build/
/build-*/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
*.exe

# What a test run leaves in the working tree: the engine test writes a PDF
# per temporary format it makes, a profiling build drops gmon.out, and a
# document whose font is missing leaves missfont.log. Probe logs written at
# the root are the same kind of thing.
/hstex-engine-test-*
/gmon.out
/missfont.log
/*.log
